   844→    ///
   845→    /// By default this assumes the network is on the `Prague` hardfork and the following
   846→    /// transactions are allowed:
   847→    ///  - Legacy
   848→    ///  - EIP-2718
   849→    ///  - EIP-1559
   850→    ///  - EIP-4844
   851→    ///  - EIP-7702
