    48→/// - Legacy
    49→/// - EIP-2718
    50→/// - EIP-1559
    51→/// - EIP-4844
    52→/// - EIP-7702
    53→///
    54→/// And enforces additional constraints such as:
    55→/// - Maximum transaction size
